data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_045542114a8a87a7016acb1907d6588193b464b05c1b78a9d6","output_index":0,"sequence_number":91,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering coding changes**\n\nI'm looking into making changes to the forms by introducing a disabled fieldset for each row. This would cover the controls, excluding the restore button. I'll wrap existing forms in a disabled fieldset, styling them to display contents while ensuring proper inheritance through Playwright. I’m thinking that replacing occurrences might be simpler in Python, but I prefer not to delve into that right now. Overall, there’s a good time budget for these adjustments."}

